        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limit Break is a game that allows you to play four games at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was inspired by watching a professional gamer play multiple games at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you need for this game is quickness, judgment, and extreme multitasking ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is designed to challenge people's limits. Break through your limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Composition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It consists of matching mushroom colors, avoiding lasers, filling pancakes, and jumping games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623580/extras/d64720c1b18e51692148a8efeee512bc.avif?t=1754044864\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623580/extras_big/d64720c1b18e51692148a8efeee512bc.avif?t=1754044864 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How To Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mushroom color matching game can be played with left and right arrows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The laser avoidance game can be played with W, A, S, and D keys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pancake games can be played with a space bar key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The jump game is playable with the up arrow.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limit Break is a game that allows you to play four games at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was inspired by watching a professional gamer play multiple games at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you need for this game is quickness, judgment, and extreme multitasking ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is designed to challenge people's limits. Break through your limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Composition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It consists of matching mushroom colors, avoiding lasers, filling pancakes, and jumping games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623580/extras/d64720c1b18e51692148a8efeee512bc.avif?t=1754044864\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623580/extras_big/d64720c1b18e51692148a8efeee512bc.avif?t=1754044864 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How To Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mushroom color matching game can be played with left and right arrows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The laser avoidance game can be played with W, A, S, and D keys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pancake games can be played with a space bar key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The jump game is playable with the up arrow.</p>",
